{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 29th edition took place on February 26, 2023, at the Fairmont Century Plaza in Century City, and was streamed on <i>Netflix</i>'s YouTube channel after the end of the contract with <i>TNT</i> and <i>TBS</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 545611, 'screen_type': movie}\">Everything Everywhere All at Once</a> (2022) won four awards (cast, actress for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1620, 'screen_type': person}\">Michelle Yeoh</a>, supporting actor for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 690, 'screen_type': person}\">Ke Huy Quan</a> and supporting actress for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 8944, 'screen_type': person}\">Jamie Lee Curtis</a>) and became the only film in the history of the awards to win four trophies, including the cast award. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 35, 'screen_type': person}\">Sally Field</a> received the lifetime achievement award. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":545611,"name":"Everything Everywhere All at Once","image_path":"/2dSZQGwijlXvMSyuGe0FSgrXnv0.jpg","director":"Daniel Scheinert, Daniel Kwan","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":615777,"name":"Babylon","image_path":"/qZUmMxJbGmkIYwnS7qRfSOREmvC.jpg","director":"Damien Chazelle","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":674324,"name":"The Banshees of Inisherin","image_path":"/rtJtaJ3ayYJ2PdwgZpEQyBETpyu.jpg","director":"Martin McDonagh","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":804095,"name":"The Fabelmans","image_path":"/meqKIZTsdSlbvv47uxvJH7Jcr7H.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":777245,"name":"Women Talking","image_path":"/lH5qPokImvjzg18DxURFS3Clmyw.jpg","director":"Sarah Polley","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":1620,"name":"Michel